graph LR
    classDef input fill:#fdf4ff,stroke:#c026d3,stroke-width:2px,color:#701a75
    classDef validate fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#22c55e,stroke-width:2px,color:#14532d
    classDef human fill:#fefce8,stroke:#eab308,stroke-width:2px,color:#713f12
    classDef execute fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12
    
    A[Model Proposal]:::input --> B[Ground Target]:::validate
    B --> C{Policy Check}:::validate
    C -- Origin Blocked --> Blocked[Rejected]:::validate
    C -- Allowed Draft --> E[Executor]:::execute
    C -- Commit Action --> D[Human Approval]:::human
    D -- Confirmed --> E
    D -- Denied --> Blocked
    E --> F[Verify Postcondition]:::validate
